m;\"><td class=\"border border-collapse border-black warm:border-brown-800 dark:border-white p-1\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"15\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; font-size: 1rem;\"></td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-original-nbme-400/10 warm:hover:bg-brown-700/10 dark:hover:bg-white/15\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><td class=\"border border-collapse border-black warm:border-brown-800 dark:border-white p-1\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; font-size: 1rem;\">Coagulation studies</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-original-nbme-400/10 warm:hover:bg-brown-700/10 dark:hover:bg-white/15\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><td class=\"border border-collapse border-black warm:border-brown-800 dark:border-white p-1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; font-size: 1rem;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0PT</td><td class=\"border border-collapse border-black warm:border-brown-800 dark:border-white p-1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; font-size: 1rem;\">20 sec</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-original-nbme-400/10 warm:hover:bg-brown-700/10 dark:hover:bg-white/15\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><td class=\"border border-collapse border-black warm:border-brown-800 dark:border-white p-1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; font-size: 1rem;\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Activated PTT</td><td class=\"border border-collapse border-black warm:border-brown-800 dark:border-white p-1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; font-size: 1rem;\">43 sec</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-4 text-start\" style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-weight: 400; font-size: 1rem;\">Which of the following sets of hematologic findings is most likely to be present in this patient?\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200c\u200b\u200c\u200c\u200c\u200c\u